From ca00212168a5b2f1006178794676acdc775d5d71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Wiklander <jens.wiklander@linaro.org>
Date: Tue, 26 Apr 2016 11:18:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1022/1695] libutee: add TUI interface and implementation

Adds Trusted UI interface and corresponding user space implementation.
A pseudo TA is defined for interaction with OP-TEE Core.

This change was picked from [1] and updated to match latest
OP-TEE OS coding style.

